<title>FRANCE: French support creation of pension funds -poll.</title>
<headline>French support creation of pension funds -poll.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three-quarters of French people are in favour of private pension funds and 62 percent plan to contribute an average monthly deposit of 510 francs, according to a Caisse d'Epargne-Les Echos poll published on Friday in the newspaper Les Echos.</p>
<p>The government plans to introduce legislation creating private pension funds this year.</p>
<p>The telephone poll was carried out by the Sofres agency with a sample of 1,002 people.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
